      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a showstopper bug.  A patch should not have been released with a known bug this serious in it.  It's not just minorly inconvenient or just a little jittery.  This bug makes VRChat unplayable for a lot of people.  This patch should be rolled back.  Fixing it a week later is not soon enough.",
