      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Hmm.  What you're experiencing with this bug must be considerably different than what me and the friends I know are experiencing with it.  The effect is continuous and severe.  Even potentially nauseating.  It's hard to even look at.  I wouldn't describe what I'm seeing as \"just jittering a bit\".\nI suppose VRChat must have decided the patch was releasable because the avatars they saw which were affected by the bug weren't experiencing such a severe effect.\nIt probably has the worst effect on furry avatars in general.  It's really bad on my nargacuga avatar, for instance.  But all of my avatars are furry, and none of them are usable.\nAlso, while the patch notes suggest that it would have fixed the issue for not being able to stick out tongues, that remains broken for phys bones on the nargacuga tongue.  No improvement at all.\nFrom my perspective, this patch is a disaster which threatens to ruin multiple events which were planned for the long weekend.  Friends are contacting me trying to find out if there's any sort of workaround or if they'll have to cancel their parties.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
