      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been an issue for me since April 23rd when Avatar Dynamics was originally released. For me it's all avatars not just \"furry\". And it's not just ears, tail, or hair, it's every part of the avatar, even arms and legs. Any part of the avatar in motion is vibrating between 3 positions that are millimeters apart. For me it's so disorienting that I've completely stopped using VRchat since April 23rd, only logging in when I see a client update or SDK update and rebuilt my Avatars with that new SDK praying that the issue goes way.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatar-dynamics-w202212-and-w202221-all-avatars-in-motion-vibratejitter",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
