      "value": "@{6090757a8a47b4579a13108e|full_name}: This seems like a very different issue. This is specifically for animated physbones, not the arms and legs themselves. Anything linked to the base skeleton isn't affected by this issue here unless somehow your avatar's full skeleton is made of physbones for some reason (which is likely not the case and if it is you should probably fix that). \nI suggest not merging it into this one as a duplicate, as this issue likely seems to be unrelated and merging it as a duplicate would reduce the chances of it being fixed.",
