  "details": "The new minor update (likely a hotfix) that just dropped today as of the time of writing seems to have broken physbones completely, with them flickering between 2 positions every frame visually when they try to return to their normal positions. \nIt's causing this weird effect where the physbones turn into 2 ghost copies of themselves, but it's impossible to screenshot because it's simply due to the flickering.\nSteps to reproduce: Load any avatar with physbones that have a pull force and start moving around to move the physbones. Sometimes this can happen when standing still as well.",
